Package: ufcdata
Type: Package
Title: Load the UFC Data Dataset
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Noah", "Bair", email = "nlbair@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Loads the UFC Data dataset of UFC fights, judges' round-by-round
    scorecards, round statistics, betting odds, and rankings. Downloads the
    published files once, checks their checksums, and keeps a copy on your
    computer. Includes a codebook lookup and helpers for betting odds. This
    project is independent and is not affiliated with the UFC.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: digest, tools, utils
Suggests: arrow, readr
URL: https://github.com/nlbair/ufcdata-r
BugReports: https://github.com/nlbair/ufcdata-r/issues
